# Student loan repo: sync the thinking, never the documents.
#
# Same posture as the other repos. The plan, the paths, the call notes and the
# rounded figures sync. Anything that came from the Department, a servicer, a
# school or the IRS stays on this machine.

# -- Filed originals and raw drops: LOCAL ONLY --------------------------------
records/*
!records/README.md
inbox/*
!inbox/README.md

# -- Documents by type, anywhere in the repo (belt and suspenders) ------------
*.pdf
*.csv
*.tsv
*.txt
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.docx
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.zip

# -- Documents by name, in case an extension is missing or odd ---------------
*MyStudentData*
*mystudentdata*
*nslds*
*NSLDS*
*statement*
*Statement*
*1040*
*tax-return*
*transcript*
*W-2*
*W2*

# -- Never, under any circumstances ------------------------------------------
*password*
*credential*
*secret*
*fsa-id*
*FSA ID*
.env
*.key
*.pem

# -- Outbox syncs except anything carrying an unreviewed figure --------------
outbox/*raw*
outbox/*export*

# -- OS / editor noise -------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
~$*
